# Deck-list format

When creating or intentionally reformatting a deck list, use one flat, alphabetized Archidekt-compatible list:

```text
1 Card Name (set) collector-number [Category,Other Category]
```

- Use quantities without `x`, such as `1` or `9`.
- Include the lowercase set code and exact collector number so Archidekt selects the intended card image.
- Keep categories and directives such as `Commander{top}` and `Maybeboard{noDeck}{noPrice}`.
- Do not add section headings or blank category groups.
- Preserve a user-submitted list exactly unless they explicitly request normalization or this format.
